# Scene1-1-14

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:19_1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:监牢的囚犯生活<br>来到了第4天——|#0101Adv18_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今天艾玛和雪莉也约好了，到放风时间<br>就一起去探索。|#0101Adv18_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而今天的目标，就是在监牢外面认真转一圈，<br>找寻越狱的方法。|#0101Adv18_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:从正门走出外面后，<br>艾玛回头望向监牢。|#0101Adv18_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_1_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是监牢……|#0101Adv18_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这么看上去，还真是相当坚固啊。|#0101Adv18_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……不过能自由外出的话，<br>肯定能在什么地方找到逃脱的出口。|#0101Adv18_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:整个宅邸处在高坡之上。<br>而且正如蕾雅所说，<br>在艾玛的眼前铺开的这道风景就像绘画一般美丽。|#0101Adv18_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 17]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:17_1

[PrintTextModified Text:有像怀抱着大地一般，不断往远处延伸的青翠森林——|#0101Adv18_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 16]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:16_1

[PrintTextModified Text:有盛放着五颜六色花朵的花田——<br>她还能听到，从不知什么地方传来溪流的流水声音。|#0101Adv18_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 19]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:19_1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:好美丽的地方……|#0101Adv18_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每当有风吹过，森林里的树木就像在低声细语般，<br>颤动着枝桠上的叶片。<br>她还能微微听见远方小鸟的欢唱声。|#0101Adv18_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里好宽广耶。<br>如果能自由出入的话，<br>说不定可以藏身在某个地方。|#0101Adv18_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。不过我很在意<br>亚里沙说过的【监视猫头鹰】。|#0101Adv18_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:确实。<br>不过看起来这附近没有它们的影子……|#0101Adv18_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:时间有限，<br>总之我们四周看看吧！|#0101Adv18_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，走吧！|#0101Adv18_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm BgmPath:Ambi_1_1 FadeOutDuration:5
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; [back 22]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:22_1

[PrintTextModified Text:沿着石砖地面的道路走，<br>能看见监牢旁边有3栋原木屋风格的建筑物。|#0101Adv18_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里是什么地方……？|#0101Adv18_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是什么地方呢。我猜是看守的住处……？<br>总之进去看看吧！|#0101Adv18_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:面前的建筑物的门上<br>都挂着耐人寻味的牌子。|#0101Adv18_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

