@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:23_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:建筑物的内部整洁而大方。<br>这里看起来不像是日常居住的地方，<br>更像是那种专为住宿设计的设施。|#0101Adv18_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里比我们的牢房漂亮多了……|#0101Adv18_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR9,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:唔唔唔……这里有可能是<br>【招待所】耶！|#0101Adv18_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:招待所……？|#0101Adv18_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果监牢的运营有国家在幕后参与，<br>我想应该会有什么高层领导会来这座监狱视察。|#0101Adv18_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哦，是这么一回事啊！|#0101Adv18_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然只是我的想像，<br>那些领导肯定不愿意住在<br>监牢里面。|#0101Adv18_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟我们可是会对世界<br>造成威胁的可怕魔女。|#0101Adv18_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这么一来，如果有领导来视察的话，<br>这个情况下，<br>他们应该就会住进这些招待所里。|#0101Adv18_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR6,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，有没觉得我的推理实在太妙了！？<br>可以的话，真想找到证据～！|#0101Adv18_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉一边自卖自夸，<br>一边举着放大镜，仔细检查房间里的每一个角落。|#0101Adv18_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那个，雪莉，<br>我想看看其他地方……|#0101Adv18_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:最终艾玛只能把<br>不情不愿的雪莉从房间里拖了出来。|#0101Adv18_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随后她们稍稍调查了其他招待所，<br>得知其室内的构造是一样的。|#0101Adv18_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 18]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:18_1

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，艾玛她们再走了一会，<br>便来到一堵高高的围墙前。|#0101Adv18_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这堵混凝土围墙不单结实，<br>而且还很高，抬头一望看不见尽头。|#0101Adv18_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:如果能到围墙另一边，<br>应该可以和外界取得联系吧？|#0101Adv18_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定可以。<br>不过，这超级高的耶。|#0101Adv18_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我试试看能不能爬上去。<br>你看，那里有一小块能落脚的地方。|#0101Adv18_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛踩上围墙裂开的地方，<br>用力爬了上去。|#0101Adv18_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然能爬到接近她自己身高的位置，<br>但艾玛再也找不到更高处的落脚点了。|#0101Adv18_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、呜呜……|#0101Adv18_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 23：どすんと落ちる音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_23 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她手指力气用尽，<br>最终还是落回了地面上。|#0101Adv18_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:行不通呢。|#0101Adv18_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:记得亚里沙说过，<br>围墙上作用着一道神奇力量，<br>或许根本就没法让人爬上去。|#0101Adv18_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你们在这里干什么呀？<br>万一被看守看见了，可是要被关进惩罚室里的哦。|#0101Adv18_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜摆出一副看傻眼的表情，不知从哪里出现了。|#0101Adv18_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们根本就不知道<br>它们会从什么地方看着我们。|#0101Adv18_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……|#0101Adv18_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一想到看守有可能藏在了树丛里，<br>艾玛便快速地扫视了周遭。|#0101Adv18_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我刚刚去了比较远的地方，<br>看到有好多监视的怪物猫头鹰在天上飞。|#0101Adv18_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这附近倒是没见耶。<br>也就只有监牢附近<br>可以不受监视自由散步了吧。|#0101Adv18_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……虽然不清楚准确的机制，<br>我猜只要往远处逃，被监视的猫头鹰发现的话，<br>看守就会收到联络。|#0101Adv18_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:猫头鹰的夜间视力应该很好……<br>这也是为了提防趁夜色昏暗越狱的囚犯吧。<br>唉……|#0101Adv18_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在她们进行对话时，<br>艾玛发现，她视野的角落处出现了一个人影。|#0101Adv18_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

; ========================================
; [char 黒部ナノカ.通常,CenterRigth]
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:（是奈叶香……？）|#0101Adv18_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 黒部ナノカ OUT
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:那人影好像有意掩人耳目，<br>马上钻进森林的草丛里，消失不见了。|#0101Adv18_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:注意到这件事的，似乎只有艾玛一个。|#0101Adv18_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，你刚其实在做什么？|#0101Adv18_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也有在找找看，有没有什么地方<br>可以逃出这里。|#0101Adv18_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你有找到逃跑的地方！？|#0101Adv18_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:45 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一下子拉近了和汉娜的距离。|#0101Adv18_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是汉娜好像不喜欢这样的距离感——<br>她往后退了一步。|#0101Adv18_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:45 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:（嗯……？是我的错觉，对吧）|#0101Adv18_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的内心有些刺痛，<br>脸上的表情也变得僵硬起来。|#0101Adv18_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过去朋友的影子在她脑海中浮现，<br>和初中时代的讨厌回忆重叠在一起。|#0101Adv18_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么可能那么顺利。你也看到了吧，<br>这附近全部都被混凝土高墙围住。|#0101Adv18_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:很遗憾，我们被困在这个地方的事实<br>没有任何改变。|#0101Adv18_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且走到远处，<br>就会碰到时常巡逻的监视猫头鹰……<br>唔，安保等级比想像中高好多。|#0101Adv18_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我还发现了一件事。|#0101Adv18_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事？|#0101Adv18_Sherry019| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里是座小岛吧。我有闻到一丝海浪的气味……<br>把耳朵贴在围墙上，还听到了波浪的声音。|#0101Adv18_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛按照汉娜所说，<br>把耳朵贴在围墙上。|#0101Adv18_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 24：微かな波音]
; ========================================

@StopBgm
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_24 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是真的……！<br>说来，我好像记得典狱长也说过，这里是一座【岛】。|#0101Adv18_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉也恍然大悟般拍了拍手。|#0101Adv18_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哦哦！虽然我早有预感了，<br>这里一定就是与世隔绝的孤岛！|#0101Adv18_Sherry020| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们应该是被迷昏了，然后被人<br>用直升机这类运输工具运过来的。|#0101Adv18_Sherry021| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且整座岛都被围墙围住，<br>想逃出这里一定很困难。|#0101Adv18_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会这样……<br>就算翻过了围墙，也还有一片大海……|#0101Adv18_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_023_001_Loop]
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_23_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:脸色惨白的汉娜咬着手指头，<br>低声自言自语着。|#0101Adv18_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一定要早点逃出这里……|#0101Adv18_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，你、你没事吧？|#0101Adv18_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:——怎么可能没事！|#0101Adv18_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆驚いて息を呑む

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0101Adv18_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可怕的怪物<br>可是时时刻刻都在监视我们哦！？|#0101Adv18_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经受够了这个地方了！！<br>而且我们以后可能也会变成那样子的怪物——|#0101Adv18_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

