; [sfx 25：壁を殴る音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_25 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@SpawnExtended Path:ShakeBackground

[PrintTextModified Text:这时突然响起一道巨大的响声，<br>把艾玛和汉娜吓了一跳。|#0101Adv18_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是雪莉她用力地砸了一下围墙。<br>气势猛烈的巨响似乎震撼了整堵围墙。|#0101Adv18_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:遗憾的是，围墙并没有倒塌。<br>甚至连一道裂痕都没有产生。|#0101Adv18_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉看着艾玛和汉娜，<br>吐了一下舌头。|#0101Adv18_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:我不忍心看汉娜那么伤心，<br>就想试试看能不能砸坏围墙，不过失败了。|#0101Adv18_Sherry022| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这堵围墙，好硬！！|#0101Adv18_Sherry023| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:竟然想赤手空拳解决问题，你的想法也太不正常了吧！？|#0101Adv18_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，汉娜……<br>大、大事不好了……|#0101Adv18_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛指着茂密树林的方向，<br>用颤抖的声音说道。|#0101Adv18_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

